        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 316 Castlecurragh Heath to the market — a spacious one-bedroom, ground-floor apartment presented in good condition throughout. Ideally positioned within the mature and ever-popular Castlecurragh Heath development, this attractive property offers plenty of potential and is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. The location is second to none, with a wide range of schools, shops, parks and leisure facilities all within easy reach. Tolka Park is right on your doorstep, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is also close by. The area is further enhanced by excellent public transport links and convenient access to major road networks, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond easily accessible. No. 316 represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-presented apartment in a highly convenient Dublin 15 location.\nBright, airy and spacious, this fantastic one-bedroom apartment offers approximately 40 sq. m. of well-proportioned and versatile living accommodation. The living space has been cleverly divided to provide an additional room, ideal for use as a home office, study or additional sleeping space. Upon entering, you are greeted by a cosy open-plan living area, which leads to the main bedroom and the additional versatile room, complete with wardrobe space. The accommodation is further complemented by a fully fitted kitchen and bathroom with the added benefit of underfloor heating. Additional features include electric heating, communal garden space, no onward chain, ample parking and a highly convenient location. This wonderful property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike, particularly those seeking a spacious and versatile home within a mature, well-established and highly convenient Dublin 15 development.\nContact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today on 086 822 5318 or 01 908 9300 to arrange a viewing. Early interest is expected — don't miss out!\nFeatures;\n- c.40 sq.m\n-1 Bed/ 1 Bath ground floor apartment\n-Blank canvas\n-Electric heating\n-Underfloor heating\n-Additional room\n-BER C\n-Management fees c. 650 p/a\n-Convenient location\n-Ample parking\n-No onward chain\n-Prime for first time buyers, downsizers & investors\n-Bus routes & schools on your doorstep\n-Close proximity to The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre\n-Within arm's reach of M50 & N3 motorway\n-Early viewing strongly advised!\n\nDirections: Eircode is D15RF4E"
      },
      {
